diff --git a/CHANGES.md b/CHANGES.md
index 1b8a5fb..87b933a 100644
--- a/CHANGES.md
+++ b/CHANGES.md
@@ -16,6 +16,9 @@ Unreleased
 - {class}`Parameter` accepts a new `help` argument and {class}`Option` and {class}`Argument`
   inherits it. {meth}`Parameter.to_info_dict` now reports `help` for every kind of parameter.
   {pr}`3861`
+- The default short help of a command no longer stops at an abbreviation. A word
+  ending with a period ends the first sentence only if it is the last word of the
+  paragraph or the next word does not start with a lowercase character.
 
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
